2:T482,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/joker-voice#blogposting","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/joker-voice","headline":"The Joker Voice","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/joker-voice","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Guy Harris","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy","image":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VoiceoverGuy","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png"}},"inLanguage":"en-GB","isAccessibleForFree":true,"description":"Need a Joker-style voiceover for Halloween or a twisted promo? Here’s my tribute to Heath Ledger’s iconic villain in The Dark Knight – ready 2 haunt your script","datePublished":"2014-07-01T00:00:00+00:00","dateModified":"2014-07-01T00:00:00+00:00","keywords":["joker voice","dark knight voice","halloween voiceover","batman villain"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/img/blog/joker-voice.jpg"}}3:T428,<h2>Incredible Bad Guys</h2>
<p>Heath Ledger gave us one of the most iconic villains of all time. And while I’m no Oscar-winner, I’ve been lucky to voice some truly twisted characters over the years. From <a href="/scary-movie-ghost-face-voice" title="Ghost Face Scream Voice">Ghost Face in Scream</a> to <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/dracula-voiceover-for-halloween" title="Dracula Voiceover" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Count Dracula</a>, my Halloween roster is full of creepy legends.<br><br>

If you're planning a promo, trailer or haunted event, I can provide a Joker-style voice or something even more terrifying. Why not pair it with a <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/spooky-halloween-laughs" title="Spooky Laughs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">signature spooky laugh</a> or go full <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/evil-character-voiceover" title="Evil Character Voice" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">evil villain</a>? Let’s give your audience the creeps, in the best possible way.</p>7:["slug","joker-voice","d"]
0:["XPBGwEKvr8cwSZUTNZgMN",[[["",{"children":[["slug","joker-voice","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"joker-voice\"}",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":[["slug","joker-voice","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",[[["$","script","schema-0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],["$","script","schema-1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/joker-voice#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"News & Blog\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceover-news\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"The Joker Voice\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/joker-voice\"}]}"}}],["$","script","schema-2",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"VideoObject\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/joker-voice#video\",\"name\":\"The Joker Voice\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/aSkVQ6lNwH4/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"embedUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aSkVQ6lNwH4\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Guy Harris\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy\",\"image\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"VoiceoverGuy\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png\"}},\"inLanguage\":\"en-GB\",\"description\":\"Need a Joker-style voiceover for Halloween or a twisted promo? Here’s my tribute to Heath Ledger’s iconic villain in The Dark Knight – ready 2 haunt your script\",\"uploadDate\":\"2014-07-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"The Joker Voice"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>I have always loved The Dark Knight, so voicing a Joker tribute was something I could not resist. Whether it is a Halloween promo, a twisted trailer or a character parody, I have got the cackle well and truly covered.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>What a Joker!</h2>\r\n<p>I could not resist having a go at one of the most iconic villains in cinema history. Heath Ledger’s Joker has a very particular rhythm to it, a mix of charm, menace and total unpredictability, and getting that right was a genuinely enjoyable challenge. You will also find me bringing all kinds of creepy voices to life for <a href=\"/halloween-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Halloween Voiceovers\">Halloween campaigns</a> across TV and radio. If you fancy something similar, take a look at my <a href=\"/character-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Character Voiceover Showreel\">character showreel</a> for more.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aSkVQ6lNwH4","title":"The Joker Voice","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/joker-voice.jpg","alt":"Heath Ledger Joker Voice – Scary Halloween Voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}]]}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>More Scary Voices Where That Came From</h2>\r\n<p>My Joker impression is just one trick from my spooky bag of voiceover treats. I’ve also been the <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-impression\" title=\"David Attenborough Voice Spoof\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">David Attenborough of the undead</a>, voiced <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/alton-towers-scarefest-spooky-voice\" title=\"Alton Towers Scarefest Voice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Alton Towers Scarefest</a> promos, and created bone-chilling <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/wilhelm-scream-shreek-shout-sfx-voiceover-film\" title=\"Wilhelm Scream\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">screams and horror SFX</a> for trailers and games.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/character-voiceovers.jpg","alt":"Heath Ledger Joker Voice – Scary Halloween Voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}]]}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Let’s put a smile on that script</h2>\r\n<p>Need a spooky Joker voice for a Halloween promo or a villainous campaign? I’ll record it fast from my broadcast studio. Send over the script or just your idea, I’ll make it sinister. <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceoverGuy\">Get in touch</a> and let’s add a little chaos to your next project.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L5",null,{"pageTitle":"The Joker Voice","pageUrl":"joker-voice"}]]}]}],["$","sectio